I — запросы перехватываются на сетевом уровне, после того как они уже покинули приложение. Это означает, что весь код приложения выполняется в штатном режиме, а моки остаются видны в DevTools. — Поддерживает REST и GraphQL, а также WebSocket.\",\"link\":\"https://github.com/mswjs/msw\"}","normalized_exact_url":"https://github.com/mswjs/msw","normalized_address_key":"github.com/mswjs/msw","url_host":"github.com","owner_repo":"mswjs/msw","semantic_class":"API","semantic_class_method":"DETERMINISTIC_HEURISTIC_NOT_UPSTREAM_VERIFIED","operation_purposes":"other_unknown","contours":"A_TOOL_CAPABILITY","historical_category":"Разработка - Фреймворки и библиотеки","historical_confidence":"low","historical_resource_type":"github_repository","historical_flags":"manual_topic_review","card_path":"20 - Записи/Разработка---Фреимворки-и-библиотеки/Радар-0486.md","card_sha256":"cd6149639fb75506b8ef0d61b71a7a2c0650b373e61be1cea86ddc14b20f61b8","exact_candidate_group_id":"DUP_d54061f6a88b84a2","exact_candidate_members":"Радар-0486","address_candidate_group_id":"DUP_22baae6ac20b3bf2","address_candidate_members":"Радар-0486","maturity_stage":"RAW_CANDIDATE","readiness":"UNVETTED","verdict":"H","evidence_level":"L1","research_status":"DOCUMENTED_L1_CROSSWALKED","classification_confidence":"MEDIUM","current_health":"UNKNOWN","installed_version":"UNKNOWN","authorized":"UNKNOWN","actually_called":"UNKNOWN","result_qa":"UNKNOWN","currently_released":"UNKNOWN","license_status":"UNKNOWN","upstream_version_release_commit":"UNKNOWN","integration_module":"UNKNOWN","current_nox_compatibility":"UNKNOWN","costs_json":"{\"build\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"maintenance\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"migration\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"recurring\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"research\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"run\":\"UNKNOWN\"}","risk_level":"UNKNOWN","data_quality_flags":"manual_topic_review","next_check":"L2: fetch canonical upstream at observed UTC; verify exact release/SHA/digest/license/runtime/security/access; keep UNKNOWN if inaccessible; current Nox read 